    "long_instructions": "## Use the Pattern to Build a New Function\r\n\r\n1. **Study the Pattern**\r\n   - Look at the parameterized function AI Tutor built in `script.js`.\r\n   - What are the inputs? Where are they used?\r\n\r\n2. **Build**\r\n   - Write a similar function for a different item.\r\n\r\n3. **Test**\r\n   - Click the new item buttons.\r\n   - Does the output change based on which item you clicked?\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code**\r\n   - Where did you define the parameters?\r\n   - Where did you use them in the function?\r\n   - Where is the function called?",
